{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/187939-dear-world","id":187939,"title":"Dear World","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-07-04T06:53:15-07:00","id":187939,"title":"Dear World","content":"Hey, we know it's kinda late notice, but we kinda forgot today is America's birthday, and we're throwing a little party. Nothing fancy; just a chill get-together with some friends. We'll barbecue something, have a beer or two, and if you want to stay 'til dark, we'll be shooting off a few fireworks. If you guys wanna come, you're welcome. Don't worry about bringing anything (unless you want a salad or something with dinner, because let's be honest, we in America are not big on salad and you can't really trust us to bring one).<br /> <br /> If you can't make it, no big deal. It's our fault for not inviting you sooner. We just wanted to let you know we'd be glad to have you.<br /> <br /> <br /> Love,<br /> <br /> America","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-04T07:28:53-07:00","id":187983,"title":"","content":"The Austrians got our invitation, at least.<br /> My pen-pal sent me this: <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><br /> <img src=\"http://www.slightlywarped.com/crapfactory/curiosities/2013/march/images/historical-photos-pt5-arnold-schwarzenegger.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>I used to know things. Forbidden things.</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/306-brasstreader","name":"Brasstreader","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar306_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-04T08:58:31-07:00","id":188012,"title":"","content":"Today, I decided to not settle. TOday, I will not celebrate being Americna. Instead,i will celebrate being part of something much larger,grander, and vibrant.<br /> <br /> I will celebrate being <i>Texan</i>.<br /> <br /> That should piss everyone off.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-04T20:44:19-07:00","id":188461,"title":"","content":"the tone of this letter is perhaps more sentimental and self-deprecating than I would expect from Columbia herself, jim, but better than no 4th of July thread. thank you for picking up the slack","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/275-leaper","name":"Leaper","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar275_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-04T21:17:37-07:00","id":188481,"title":"","content":"This country isn't perfect. No country is, or ever has been. But it's better than just about any other.<br /> <br /> In this land, waking up with the fear that something or someone is coming for you in the night is an aberration, rather than merely unusual, or god help us, the norm. There are far, far too many nations where that cannot be said. The assurance of safety when you go to bed at night is a blessing that many, myself included, may never be able to fully appreciate, never experiencing the alternative ourselves.<br /> <br /> Yes, we and our forebears have made mistakes. But this nation has come a long, long way and built a solid foundation to go even farther. That alone is worthy of pride.<br /> <br /> And so I say without irony, hesitation or doubt, May God Bless America.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm feeling bluuuueeeee~","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/175-prometheus878","name":"Prometheus878","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar175_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1477"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-08T23:18:19-07:00","id":192089,"title":"","content":"The fireworks sounded like gunshots and gave me combat flashbacks.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>A Green Sun Destrier</i>","edited":{"userid":77,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/77-kongurous","user":"kongurous","date":". 07-09-2014, 07:11 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/77-kongurous","name":"kongurous","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar77_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"417"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-09T05:56:42-07:00","id":192307,"title":"","content":"My sympathies.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-10T13:34:51-07:00","id":193925,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_conta