s that I couldn\u2019t subjugate my journey to the gods, while dreaming of rebirth at the end of distant time, like other pharaohs.\u201d Ramesses II, Fate/Prototype: Argent Fragments.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2918-kat","name":"Kat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2918_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1762"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-13T11:58:15-07:00","id":196509,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prometheus878</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/187939-dear-world?p=195920#post195920\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Edit2: You know what, I'm calling this whole thing off. I'm perpetuating an argument on the internet, and that never serves a purpose.<br /> <br /> America can stand on its own; it doesn't my meager words to defend it. So go on with your criticisms; you're entitled to them.<br /> <br /> Good day.</div> </div> </div> </div>Sensitive aren't we. I didn't get read the unedited post.<br /> My point to my fellow Americans is the &quot;rah rah go team &quot; attitude blinds us to problems that stand in the way of our quest for <b><i>a more perfect union.</i></b><br /> If we strive for Jefferson's view that we are a work in progress then we have to engage in critical thinking about our country.<br /> To me that is patriotism. If only more people understood it was patriotic to question the drumbeat to go war with Iraq, we might be in a better place as a nation.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>If you want By Night Studios to release new LARP RULES for NWoD,<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/313137-open-letter-to-by-night-studios\" target=\"_blank\">like this post</a>.<br /> <br /> <img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=62\" data-tempid=\"temp_62_1418088885567_853\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/594-chattnos","name":"Chattnos","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar594_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"879"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-13T14:51:16-07:00","id":196581,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Katsura</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/187939-dear-world?p=196250#post196250\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I usually complain when US of A is overdoing with interventionism. Just look how unseating Saddam Hussein destabilized the region. He did good job at keeping Sunni fundamentalist wackos in check, even if a tyrant.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm looking at other things;<br /> <br /> If the US went to such a policy I would think that the Middle East would implode. Taiwan would finally have to shut up and follow China's dictates. NATO would dissolve (among other treaties) Putin could get the merry band that was the USSR back together since the US wouldn't be getting pushy with the EU. And without US money flowing in to help European banks, I should think the the EU would eventually dissolve. There's so much more than I could hastily post...<br /> <br /> It's unrealistic (and frankly not in the US' best interests) to consider that the US would ever re-establish such a policy, but who knows.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Mankind was once an endangered species. It will likely be so again. And mankind will only have itself to blame.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/144-shadowflame","name":"Shadowflame","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar144_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1223"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-14T10:02:55-07:00","id":196924,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> And without US money flowing in to help European banks, I should think the the EU would eventually dissolve. There's so much more than I could hastily post... </div> </div> </div>It's Merkel and German government which is contributing most to recovery of European Union. And there is already substantial progress as Greece is no longer in danger of getting bankrupt, for example.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cI am absolute, I am perfect, I am supreme. I shall be eternal. My tragedy, is that there is no other fate for me. My powerlessness was that I couldn\u2019t subjugate my journey to the gods, while dreaming of rebirth at the end of distant time, like other pharaohs.\u201d Ramesses II, Fate/Prototype: Argent Fragments.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"l